# Mimeo Stone (hidden quest mimeoStone): a level 75 Warrior in Attohwa Chasm. The first Luminant (16806290, normal):
# the Mimeo Stone (npcUtil.giveKeyItem), MIMEO_STONE_PICKUP, handleLuminantUsed (the Luminant goes CUTSCENE_ONLY), the
# locals NumFades / Progress 0, a 50-90 s timer; nil (no default). The sixth Luminant (normal), the stone held:
# NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; nil. The Cradle of Rebirth, Progress 0: MIMEO_STONE_BRIGHTNESS_OFFSET + 0; the Regain
# Feather not held: the next NPC's 'krtu' animation, Progress 1, 2; finished: the stone taken, the Regain Feather. The
# Cradle again (no stone): the check fails: its default (NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY). The Luminant's player:timer
# (stoneTimer, 50-90 s: no fade before the Cradle here, the steps take less than 50 s of harness clock) runs in the last
# tick, past the upper bound, and stops: no stone. The first Luminant also says NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY (see #fades).
lists AttohwaChasm/Luminant/onTrigger AttohwaChasm/Cradle_of_Rebirth/onTrigger AttohwaChasm/onEventFinish/2
char zone=AttohwaChasm pos=241,19,-150 job=WAR lvl=75
login
trigger Luminant                        # the stone; MIMEO_STONE_PICKUP; the Luminant CUTSCENE_ONLY; the timer; nil
trigger Luminant+5                      # the stone held: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY; nil
trigger Cradle_of_Rebirth               # BRIGHTNESS + 0; krtu; Progress 1; 2
finish                                  # the stone taken; the Regain Feather
trigger Cradle_of_Rebirth               # no stone: the check fails: its default, NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
finish-if-event
tick 90001                              # past the upper bound: stoneTimer runs with no stone: it stops, nothing said
